---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AffiliateLink from "../../components/AffiliateLink.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Elden Ring — Base Game vs GOTY vs DLC"
  description="A buying guide for Elden Ring: edition differences, the Shadow of the Erdtree DLC, platform choices, and where to buy cheapest."
>
  <article class="post">
    <h1>Elden Ring — Base Game vs GOTY vs DLC</h1>
    <p class="meta">Cross-platform · Updated 2026-08-05</p>

    <p>
      <strong>Elden Ring</strong> is FromSoftware's open-world action-RPG co-directed
      with George R. R. Martin. It blends punishing combat with total freedom to
      explore the Lands Between at your own pace.
    </p>

    <h2>Editions explained</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Base game</strong> — the full open-world experience</li>
      <li><strong>Shadow of the Erdtree Edition</strong> — base game + the major DLC expansion</li>
      <li><strong>DLC sold separately</strong> — only buy if you already own the base game</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      If you're starting fresh, the edition that bundles the DLC is the cleanest
      purchase — Shadow of the Erdtree is widely regarded as a full second game's
      worth of content.
    </p>

    <h2>Platform choice</h2>
    <p>
      Elden Ring plays on every modern platform. Performance is smoothest on PS5 /
      Xbox Series and PC; last-gen consoles are playable but choppier.
    </p>

    <h2>Where to buy cheapest</h2>
    <p>
      Key stores consistently undercut the physical disc and sometimes the console
      stores, especially for the base game now that it's mature. Compare a GMG key
      against Steam / console-store sales before you buy.
    </p>

    <h2>Where to buy</h2>
    <ul class="buy-list">
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="gmg"
          href="https://www.greenmangaming.com/search/?q=elden+ring"
          cta="Check Green Man Gaming"
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="amazon"
          href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Elden+Ring"
          cta="Check on Amazon"
        />
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="note">
      Prices change frequently — always verify on the store before purchasing.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .post { padding: 1.5rem 0; max-width: 720px; }
  .post h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .buy-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
